---
import SpanishPublicLayout from '../../layouts/SpanishPublicLayout.astro';
---

<SpanishPublicLayout title="Contacto" description="Contacto con la Sociedad Coral Polifónica de Pontevedra.">
<div class="container contacto-page-wrapper">
<header class="contacto-header"><p class="sobrelinea">Habla con nosotros</p><h1>Contacto</h1><div class="section-line-center"></div><p class="contacto-intro">¿Tienes alguna duda, quieres solicitar la participación de la Coral en un acto o visitar un ensayo? Envíanos tu mensaje y responderemos lo antes posible.</p></header>

<div class="contacto-grid">
<section class="contacto-form-block" aria-labelledby="titulo-form-contacto"><h2 id="titulo-form-contacto">Envíanos un mensaje</h2><div class="section-line"></div>
<form id="form-contacto" class="contacto-form" data-solicitud-form data-orixe="Contacto" data-version-legal="formularios-web-v1-2026-07-25">
<div class="form-row"><div class="form-group"><label for="contacto-nome">Nombre completo *</label><input type="text" id="contacto-nome" name="nomeCompleto" maxlength="140" autocomplete="name" required /></div><div class="form-group"><label for="contacto-email">Correo electrónico *</label><input type="email" id="contacto-email" name="correoElectronico" maxlength="160" autocomplete="email" required /></div></div>
<div class="form-row"><div class="form-group"><label for="contacto-telefono">Teléfono</label><input type="tel" id="contacto-telefono" name="telefono" maxlength="40" autocomplete="tel" /></div><div class="form-group"><label for="contacto-entidade">Entidad u organización</label><input type="text" id="contacto-entidade" name="entidade" maxlength="180" autocomplete="organization" /></div></div>
<div class="form-group"><label for="contacto-tipo">Asunto de interés *</label><select id="contacto-tipo" name="tipoSolicitude" required><option value="" selected disabled>Selecciona una opción…</option><option value="Contratación artística">Contratación artística</option><option value="Consulta xeral">Consulta general</option><option value="Visita a ensaio">Visita a un ensayo</option><option value="Prensa e comunicación">Prensa y comunicación</option><option value="Outra">Otra consulta</option></select></div>
<div class="form-group"><label for="contacto-mensaxe">Mensaje *</label><textarea id="contacto-mensaxe" name="mensaxe" rows="7" maxlength="4000" required placeholder="Explícanos con detalle el motivo de tu consulta…"></textarea></div>
<div class="campo-trampa" aria-hidden="true"><label for="contacto-website">Sitio web</label><input type="text" id="contacto-website" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" /></div>
<label class="privacidade"><input type="checkbox" name="aceptacionProteccionDatos" required /><span>Acepto que la Sociedad Coral Polifónica de Pontevedra trate estos datos exclusivamente para responder a mi solicitud, conforme a la <a href="/es/privacidad/" target="_blank">política de privacidad</a>. *</span></label>
<div class="form-actions"><button type="submit" class="btn-enviar">Enviar mensaje</button><p class="form-status" data-form-status aria-live="polite" hidden></p></div>
</form></section>

<aside class="contacto-info-block"><div class="info-card"><h2>Datos institucionales</h2><div class="section-line"></div><ul class="info-list"><li><strong>Sociedad Coral Polifónica de Pontevedra</strong></li><li><strong>Dirección</strong><br />Rúa Luís Braille 40<br />36003 Pontevedra</li><li><strong>Correo electrónico</strong><br /><a href="mailto:coralpolifonicapontevedra@gmail.com" class="info-link">coralpolifonicapontevedra@gmail.com</a></li><li><strong>Teléfono</strong><br /><a href="tel:+34681254688" class="info-link">681 254 688</a></li></ul></div><a class="map-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=R%C3%BAa+Lu%C3%ADs+Braille+40%2C+36003+Pontevedra" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Ver la dirección en Google Maps</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></aside>
</div>
</div>
<script src="/js/solicitudes-web-es.js" defer></script>
</SpanishPublicLayout>

<style>
.contacto-page-wrapper{padding-top:clamp(2.5rem,6vw,4rem);padding-bottom:6rem}.contacto-header{max-width:800px;margin:0 auto clamp(2.75rem,6vw,4rem);text-align:center}.sobrelinea{color:var(--color-principal);font-size:.82rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.16em;margin:0 0 .85rem;text-transform:uppercase}.contacto-header h1{color:var(--color-principal);font-size:clamp(2.25rem,5vw,3.8rem);font-weight:700;line-height:1;margin:0}.section-line-center,.section-line{height:2px;background:var(--color-acento)}.section-line-center{width:60px;margin:1rem auto 1.5rem}.section-line{width:35px;margin:.6rem 0 2rem}.contacto-intro{font-size:clamp(1.02rem,2vw,1.15rem);line-height:1.65;margin:0;opacity:.85}.contacto-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(290px,370px);gap:clamp(2.5rem,6vw,4rem);align-items:start}.contacto-form-block h2,.contacto-info-block h2{color:var(--color-principal);font-size:clamp(1.35rem,2.5vw,1.6rem);font-weight:700;margin:0}.contacto-form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.35rem}.form-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1.25rem}.form-group{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.5rem}.form-group label,.privacidade{font-size:.9rem;font-weight:600}.form-group input,.form-group select,.form-group textarea{width:100%;border:1px solid rgba(106,27,41,.22);border-radius:5px;background:#fff;color:var(--color-texto);font:inherit;font-size:1rem;padding:.85rem 1rem}.form-group textarea{min-height:150px;resize:vertical}.form-group input:focus,.form-group select:focus,.form-group textarea:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--color-principal);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(106,27,41,.08)}.privacidade{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:.75rem;align-items:start;line-height:1.5;font-weight:400}.privacidade input{margin-top:.25rem}.campo-trampa{position:absolute;left:-10000px;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden}.form-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem 1.25rem;align-items:center}.btn-enviar{border:0;border-radius:4px;background:var(--color-principal);color:#fff;cursor:pointer;font:inherit;font-size:.85rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;padding:.95rem 1.6rem;text-transform:uppercase}.btn-enviar:hover{background:var(--color-acento)}.btn-enviar:disabled{cursor:wait;opacity:.65}.form-status{flex:1 1 260px;font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.45;margin:0}.form-status[data-state="success"]{color:#23633b}.form-status[data-state="error"]{color:#8b1f2d}.contacto-info-block{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1rem}.info-card{padding:2rem;background:var(--color-gris);border:1px solid rgba(106,27,41,.08)}.info-list{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.35rem;color:#45413e}.info-list li{line-height:1.6}.info-link{color:var(--color-principal);text-decoration:none;word-break:break-word}.map-link{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;padding:1rem 1.2rem;border:1px solid rgba(106,27,41,.16);color:var(--color-principal);font-size:.82rem;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none}.map-link:hover{background:var(--color-gris)}@media(max-width:850px){.contacto-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.contacto-info-block{max-width:600px}}@media(max-width:600px){.form-row{grid-template-columns:1fr}.contacto-page-wrapper{padding-inline:1rem}}
</style>